FailAt 21
Stack 100000
Echo "GLBench Burn: Pelt for ten minutes, the picture checked"
Echo "every 250 frames. Esc ends it sooner. The result also goes"
Echo "to RAM:GLBench-Result.txt."
CPU CHECK 68881 >NIL:
If WARN
  Echo "GLBench needs a 68881, a 68882 or a 68040/68060 FPU."
  Quit 20
EndIf
CPU CHECK 68040 >NIL:
If WARN
  C/GLBench030 BURN=10
Else
  C/GLBench BURN=10
EndIf
